**方案 C：伪造回包 + 签名**

```python
# 先从客户端抠出验签公钥 [样本路径]：搜索 RSA 公钥 DER / PEM 嵌在资源或 .so/.dll 里
# 再用私钥对假回包签名
import json, base64
from cryptography.hazmat.primitives import hashes, serialization
from cryptography.hazmat.primitives.asymmetric import padding

priv = serialization.load_pem_private_key(open('[私钥路径]','rb').read(), password=None)

resp = {"status":"ok","expire":"2099-12-31","product":"[产品ID]","features":["all"]}
