  +0x10  TUObjectArray ObjObjects
           +0x00  int32     NumElements
           +0x08  UObject** Objects      // 块指针数组
           +0x10  int32     MaxElements
           +0x18  int32     NumChunks
           +0x20  int32     MaxChunks
           +0x28  FUObjectItem* ChunkedObjects  // 固定块
```

